 if(id==='save')text=bn?'এই browser-এ design, preferences, completed run এবং validated active-flight checkpoint autosave হয়। Refresh-এর পরে অসমাপ্ত flight paused অবস্থায় Resume করুন; storage blocked/full/private mode হলে save নাও থাকতে পারে। অন্য browser/device-এ save যায় না। Download read-only report হলো JSON ফলাফল; এটি playable restore file নয়। Browser storage পরিষ্কার করলে save মুছে যায়। Standalone HTML offline চলে, তবে file:// storage সব browser-এ স্থায়ী নাও হতে পারে।':'This browser autosaves your design, preferences, completed runs and a validated active-flight checkpoint. After refresh, resume the unfinished flight from a paused state. Storage may be unavailable, full or temporary in private browsing. Saves do not sync across devices/browsers. Share the website to let friends start their own missions; exported reports can be shared for reading only. Download read-only report exports JSON results; it is not a playable restore file. Clearing browser storage removes saves. Standalone HTML works offline, but file:// storage persistence varies by browser.';
 if(id==='fuel')text=bn?`Fuel বাড়ালে Δv ও launch mass বাড়ে। ${body}-এর শিক্ষামূলক capture requirement ${m.maneuver} m/s, reserve ${m.reserve} m/s। Δv হলো গতি পরিবর্তনের ক্ষমতা, বর্তমান speed নয়। বাস্তব transfer trajectory হিসাব হয় না।`:`Fuel adds maneuver capability and launch mass. This ${body} game scenario uses ${m.maneuver} m/s capture/correction plus ${m.reserve} m/s reserve. Δv is possible change in velocity, not current speed. The rocket equation uses wet mass, dry mass and specific impulse. This is not a full transfer-trajectory calculation.`;
 if(id==='mass')text=bn?`Wet mass launch limit-এর বেশি, cost ${m.budget} credits-এর বেশি বা bus–recorder incompatibility হলে launch বন্ধ। Readiness-এর প্রতিটি blocker ঠিক করুন।`:`Launch is blocked when wet mass exceeds the launcher limit, cost exceeds ${m.budget} credits or the recorder is incompatible with the bus. Resolve each readiness blocker and recheck all margins.`;
