 if(id==='distance')text=bn?`${body}-এর selected distance scenario-তে inverse-square rule দিয়ে link scale হয়। Distance/light speed দিয়ে one-way signal delay দেখানো হয়; controls-এ delay লাগে না। এগুলো fixed teaching scenarios, আজকের অবস্থান নয়।`:`The selected ${body} distance scenario scales the link using an educational inverse-square approximation. Distance / speed of light gives displayed one-way delay; commands are not delayed. These fixed teaching scenarios are not a live ephemeris. Different mission antennas are normalized to each destination's reference distance, not a claim that identical lunar hardware works unchanged at Mars.`;
