 if(id==='time')text=bn?`Launch/transfer/capture সংক্ষিপ্ত game stage। Capture-এর পরে ${m.duration} মিনিট campaign শুরু। +5 min সর্বোচ্চ পাঁচ simulated মিনিট চলে, crisis-এ থামে। Pause-এ clock থামে; speed playback বদলায়, physics নয়।`:`Launch, transfer and capture are compressed game stages. The ${m.duration}-minute campaign starts after capture. +5 min advances at most five simulated minutes and stops for a crisis. Physics steps split at contact and shadow boundaries. Pause freezes mission time; playback speed does not change the physics.`;
